<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>효식(孝食) - 나만의 웹 주소 QR 생성기</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-[#F4F1DE] min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 text-[#1D2D44]">

    <div class="bg-white max-w-md w-full rounded-3xl shadow-2xl border-4 border-[#3A5A40] p-6 space-y-6 text-center">
        
        <div class="space-y-1">
            <h1 class="text-3xl font-black">효식 <span class="text-[#E07A5F] font-normal">孝食</span></h1>
            <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 font-bold">생성된 진짜 주소를 아래에 넣으면 접속되는 QR이 만들어집니다.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-amber-50 border-2 border-dashed border-amber-300 rounded-2xl p-5 flex flex-col items-center justify-center space-y-3">
            <div class="p-3 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow border border-stone-200">
                <img id="qrImg" src="" alt="QR 코드" class="w-48 h-48 object-contain">
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-2 text-left">
            <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-stone-700">무료 서버에서 생성된 진짜 주소 (URL)</label>
            <div class="flex space-x-2">
                <input type="text" id="urlInput" value="https://google.com" class="flex-1 px-3 py-2 bg-stone-50 border border-stone-300 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#3A5A40]">
                <button onclick="updateQR()" class="px-4 py-2 bg-[#3A5A40] text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-xs shadow">
                    QR 갱신
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <script>
        function setQR(url) {
            const img = document.getElementById("qrImg");
            img.src = `https://api.qrserver.com/v1/create-qr-code/?size=200x200&data=${encodeURIComponent(url)}&color=1D2D44&bgcolor=ffffff`;
        }

        function updateQR() {
            const val = document.getElementById("urlInput").value.trim();
            if (val) setQR(val);
        }

        window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
            setQR(document.getElementById("urlInput").value);
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
